rc=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936880/extras/a459259ea90e3a022a297a1ff5bb1f3c.mp4?t=1766061955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Upgrade the autoclicker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you earn to buy and upgrade the autoclicker, a technological marvel that will turn the crank for you without stopping. At first it will be slow and clumsy, but with the right upgrades it will become a real beast of rotation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase its speed, reduce the risk of overheating, and optimize each turn until you achieve absolute efficiency. Little by little, you'll stop turning the crank yourself... and start running an entire perpetual motion factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936880/extras/df3c3dcc91cb746fc8032c831688d9ce.poster.avif?t=1766061955\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936880/extras/df3c3dcc91cb746fc8032c831688d9ce.webm?t=1766061955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936880/extras/df3c3dcc91cb746fc8032c831688d9ce.mp4?t=1766061955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Upgrade the Lab</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade the <strong>Lab</strong>, where science and obsession with spinning come together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, this research center will give you <strong>unique upgrades</strong> that can multiply your money production as if you were a quantum spinning genius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your <strong>Research Points</strong> wisely, because every experiment here comes at a cost... and some could (metaphorically) blow up in your face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the lab running, upgrade it, and remember: <strong>science never rests... but you should.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936880/extras/f57b1627498cf2f7ac4af62ae744719f.poster.avif?t=1766061955\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936880/extras/f57b1627498cf2f7ac4af62ae744719f.webm?t=1766061955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936880/extras/f57b1627498cf2f7ac4af62ae744719f.mp4?t=1766061955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crank the handle.</strong> Again. And again. And again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite progression system.</strong> Every turn brings you closer to madness... and more money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable auto-clicker.</strong> Let the machine do the work (until it overheats).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret science lab.</strong> Research, unlock and upgrade absurd technology no ethics board would approve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passive upgrades.</strong> From CrossFit gyms to the very power of the universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of Steam achievements.</strong> Because nothing says success like unlocking <i>\u201cCrank Harder.\u201d</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-industrial aesthetic.</strong> Like if the 80s and a nuclear generator had a baby.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sounds and music.</strong> Perfect for endless spinning (or until your finger gives up).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humor and corporate self-destruction.</strong> Because cranking the wheel of capitalism has never been this literal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Message from the Developers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing <strong>Loop my Crank.</strong> The world of video games is something special, and being part of it is unique. We hope you enjoy this game as much as we enjoyed creating it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>love</strong>, your favorite devs :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thanks for giving the game a spin &lt;3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936880/extras/d01d83b375c15f68f786186f8c3686a1.avif?t=1766061955\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936880/extras_big/d01d83b375c15f68f786186f8c3686a1.webp?t=1766061955 width=1560 height=406 /></span></p>","developers":["GameRoom3 Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936880/912e4b4c9471b117e6adde6d12a088104c98b4df/header.jpg?t=1766061955","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3936880/653046719/5f33ddf4af2a19d02d37e9ba27e927332d9112c2/1763054339/dash_av1.mpd?t=17